### F1 - Get existing product: expect 200 with JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Accept: application/json

### F1 - Get unknown product: expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/999
Accept: application/json

### F1 - Set invalid product: expect 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/abc
Accept: application/json



# Feature 3 - Registeren
### F3 - Register: expect 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "di-test@mail.com",
  "password": "MyTestPassword123",
  "displayName": "DITest"
}

### F3 - Register with a role in the body: expect 400 (unknown field is refused)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-test@mail.com",
  "password": "MytestPassWOrd1!",
  "displayName": "PieterTest",
  "role": "COLLECTOR"
}

### F3 - Register with an existing email: expect 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-test@mail.com",
  "password": "MytestPassWOrd12!",
  "displayName": "HenkTest"
}

### F3 - Register with the same email in other casing: expect 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nEW-TEst@maIL.com",
  "password": "MytestPassWOrd12!",
  "displayName": "HenkTest"
}

### F3 - Register with a too short password: expect 422, field password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "collector@mail.com",
  "password": "short",
  "displayName": "LisaTest"
}

### F3 - Register with a too long password: expect 422, field password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nogeenmail@mail.com",
  "password": "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz",
  "displayName": "EllaTest"
}

### F3 - Register with an invalid email: expect 422, field email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "GeenMail.Adres",
  "password": "TestWachtwoord123444",
  "displayName": "EllaTest"
}

### F3 - Register with a blank display name: expect 422, field displayName
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "weereenmail@mail.com",
  "password": "TesttWachtwoord1267",
  "displayName": ""
}

### F3 - Register with a missing field: expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "Testwachtwoorddd",
  "displayName": "NepNaam"
}

### Feature 3 - Login
### F3 - Login with valid credentials: expect 200 with token and role
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "di-test@mail.com",
  "password": "MyTestPassword123"
}

### F3 - Login with the same email in other casing: expect 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "di-TEst@maIL.Com",
  "password": "MyTestPassword123"
}


### F3 - Login with a wrong password: expect 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "di-test@mail.com",
  "password": "MyTestPassword123!!"
}

### F3 - Login with an unknown email: expect 401 (same message as wrong password)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "geengeregistreerd@mailadres.com",
  "password": "MyTestPassword123"
}

### F3 - Login with a missing field: expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ontbrekende@informatie.com"
}